    "description": "Serve as a senior technical leader responsible for enterprise platform modernization, cloud transformation, application security, release engineering, and operational resiliency. Lead architecture planning, modernization strategy, and technical delivery for complex initiatives supporting enterprise applications and services.\n\nLead the modernization of the organization's internal home page, guiding its transformation from a legacy distributed platform to OpenShift and Kubernetes, while defining future-state architecture, API design, deployment patterns, infrastructure requirements, security controls, and operational-readiness practices. Align architects, product owners, infrastructure teams, security partners, and business stakeholders around strategic objectives.\n\nLead source-control and software-delivery modernization using GitHub Cloud, CI/CD pipelines, and build automation, improving scalability, maintainability, delivery speed, and alignment with enterprise engineering standards.\n\nStrengthen application security and operational resilience through security remediation, technical reviews, certificate-management practices, and platform improvements. Guide infrastructure modernization while maintaining service continuity and production readiness.\n\nProvide technical leadership for release engineering, modernization planning, architecture reviews, operational support, and engineering best practices. Mentor engineers on OpenShift, Kubernetes, cloud migration, CI/CD, application security, production readiness, and troubleshooting.\n\nLeverage AI-assisted development tools, including GitHub Copilot, to accelerate code migration, modernization, testing, documentation, and architecture activities. Develop reusable engineering patterns, automation solutions, and modernization accelerators that improve delivery consistency and team productivity.",
